
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7025

### Dohvat svih škola
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools
Accept: application/json

### Dodavanje nove škole
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Osnovna škola Demo 4",
  "oib": "98765432102",
  "address": "Školska ulica 12",
  "city": "Varaždin"
}

### Ureðivanje škole
PUT https://localhost:7025/api/schools/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Osnovna škola Demo - Ažurirano",
  "oib": "12345678901",
  "address": "Nova školska ulica 15",
  "city": "Varaždin"
}

### Deaktiviranje škole
DELETE https://localhost:7025/api/schools/5